flowchart TD
    A[Typed task request] --> B{Plan valid?}
    B -->|No| X[Reject duplicate, missing edge or cycle]
    B -->|Yes| C[Dependency-ready queue]
    C --> D[Bounded worker pool]
    D --> E[Registered operation]
    E --> F[Idempotency ledger]
    F --> G[Atomic checkpoint]
    G --> H{All dependencies complete?}
    H -->|Yes| C
    H -->|No, failure| I[Stop new dispatch]
    I --> J[Block dependents]
    J --> K[Compensate in reverse order]
    K --> L[Audited failed outcome]
